"and then tick the confirmation box."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_fio.field_account_bank_statement_line__fio_movement_id
msgid ""
"Fio's ID pohybu — unique per movement, and the key this integration "
"deduplicates on."
msgstr ""

#. module: account_statement_fio
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_statement_fio.field_account_bank_statement_line__fio_instruction_id
msgid ""
"Fio's ID pokynu. NOT unique: a transfer and its fee share one, and so do a "
"payment and its later reversal — which is why it is never used for duplicate"
" detection. It is also a different number from the batch id returned when a "
"payment order is uploaded, so it cannot link a statement line back to a "
"payment order either."
msgstr ""

